{"title": "Cutting Words (passive feature)", "pageid": 40371, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cutting_Words_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Class features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Cutting_Words_passive_feature.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Cutting_Words_passive_feature.webp/300px-Cutting_Words_passive_feature.webp, /w/images/8/8b/Cutting_Words_passive_feature.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Cutting_Words_passive_feature.webp/300px-Cutting_Words_passive_feature.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Cutting_Words_passive_feature.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Cutting Words</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Lore\" title=\"College of Lore\">College of Lore</a> Bards that grants a reaction to apply a penalty die to attack rolls, saving throws, and ability checks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Use your wit to distract a creature and sap its confidence. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cutting_Words\" title=\"Cutting Words\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Cutting_Words_Icon.webp/40px-Cutting_Words_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Cutting_Words_Icon.webp/60px-Cutting_Words_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5c/Cutting_Words_Icon.webp/80px-Cutting_Words_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cutting Words\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5c/Cutting_Words_Icon.webp/40px-Cutting_Words_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5c/Cutting_Words_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cutting_Words\" title=\"Cutting Words\">Cutting Words</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/College_of_Lore\" title=\"College of Lore\">College of Lore</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203043\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.031 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 691/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 4307/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1498/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 758864/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.046      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   27.046      1 -total\n 15.89%    4.297      1 Template:PageSeo\n 14.79%    3.999      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.94%    3.771      1 Template:SAI\n 11.92%    3.224      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 11.89%    3.217      1 Template:Icon_link\n 10.71%    2.897      1 Template:Icon_text\n 10.62%    2.871      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  7.07%    1.913      2 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:40371-0!canonical and timestamp 202607142